  "prefLabel": "Env-A 601.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 601.02 Applicability. This chapter shall apply to each stationary source, area source, and device that is required by RSA 125-C:11 to possess a temporary permit or operating permit, whether a permit-by-notification, general permit, or individual operating permit, prior to construction, installation, operation, or modification of such source or device.\n\nSource. #1375, eff 7-1-79; ss by #1717, eff 2-19-81; ss by #2332, eff 4-29-83; ss by #2938, eff 12-27-84; ss by #5033, eff 12-27-90; ss by #6057-B, eff 6-30-95; ss by #7879, eff 4-26-03; ss and moved by #8129, eff 7-28-04 (formerly Env-A 602.01); ss by #10000, eff 10-1-11; ss by #10175, eff 9-1-12; ss by #13510, eff 12-17-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a600.html"
